  "bodyText": "Sejda All Tools Compress Edit Fill & Sign Merge Delete Pages Crop Pricing Desktop Log in Create Fillable PDF Online Free PDF forms creator. Make existing PDF documents fillable Upload PDF file Toggle Dropdown or start with a blank document Files stay private. Automatically deleted after 2 hours. Free service for documents up to 200 pages or 50 MB and 3 tasks per hour. Terms of Use and Privacy Policy OFFLINE Rather work offline? Try Sejda Desktop How To Create A Fillable PDF Form Free Below we show how to convert a PDF to a fillable form Select an existing PDF document Click on 'Upload' to choose a file. No existing document? Start with a blank template. Add fillable form fields to your PDF form Go over your document's existing content and add fillable form fields where necessary. You can choose from the following field types: Text Field: single text line Textarea: multiple text lines Radio: select only one from a group Checkbox: tick one or more choices Dropdown: choose one or more options from a drop-down list Signature box: signature box for others to sign How to create a fillable PDF text field Click on the text field item from the menu. The click on the page to place a new text field. Create checkboxes, radio buttons or dropdown All other form fields can be added the same way. Radio buttons are grouped together in unison by using the same form field name for all buttons. This ensures only one is selected at the same time. When the user selects one, the other radio buttons in the group are deselected. Change border color. Configure text color in PDF form fields Have form fields with a transparent border or pick the color that suits you best. The color of the text of the PDF fields can be configured. The text alignment can be configured as 'Left', 'Center' or 'Right'. The font size can be set to a specific value or left as 'Auto' to that it automatically adjusts based on the amount of text typed in. Control form field names and other properties Define the name for each form field and configure specific field properties, such as multiselect, export values and more. Mark any field as required, so it must be completed before the form can be submitted. For text fields, you can also set a maximum character length to limit input. Text fields can be displayed as a comb field, dividing the input area into equally spaced boxes, one per character. Commonly used for date fields, postal codes, ID numbers, and similar structured inputs. Change PDF tab order Need to control the order in which fields are tabbed through? Click 'Reorder' to reorder form fields by dragging and dropping, or auto-sort them by rows or columns. Align PDF fields, multi-select and duplicate across pages Select multiple form fields at once and duplicate them to a different page, handy when building multi-page forms with repeating sections. Use the alignment tools to line up multiple form fields with each other. Align by left, right, top, or bottom edge for a clean, professional layout. Publish for others to fill & sign Once your form is ready, use 'Publish' button to generate a shareable link. Anyone with the link can open the form, fill it out, and send it back to you by email. The link does not expire and can be shared on a website or in an email. Save your document Click on 'Apply changes'. When processing completes, save your updated document. You should have a fillable PDF document that can be easily filled out electronically, without printing. Ready to create a fillable PDF online? Create a PDF form . . . . . . . . . . . . RESOURCES Pricing & Upgrade Sejda for Desktop Sejda for G Suite Sejda for Education About Blog API HTML to PDF API Developer Docs LEGAL Terms of Use Privacy Policy Cookies Privacy Settings Security SLA Made in Amsterdam © Sejda BV 2013-present. Thank you for your time. TOOLS Add PDF Page Numbers Alternate & Mix PDF Bates Numbering PDF Compress PDF Create PDF Bookmarks Crop PDF Delete PDF Annotations Delete PDF Pages Deskew PDF